    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "could u expand a bit more on the 'stifling competition' part? like what are some actual ways these companies actually do that? and then maybe do the same for the other side about why regulation might be bad for innovation. i want to make sure the briefing doesn't look lopsided.",
