      "content": "that makes sense. i was reading an article that said the self-preferencing thing is pretty much proven at this point and that these companies are basically untouchable unless the government actually steps in. based on everything you've seen, do you think the current antitrust laws are actually enough to handle these tech giants or are they basically obsolete?",
